# Rider app: sign in, open the active delivery, complete it with the customer's OTP.
wait 12
shot 01-start
dump 01-start
type Rider.mobile|^9876543210$ 9000000099
type Your.rider.password|^Password$ Rider@1234
hidekb
tap Sign in as rider
wait 8
tapif ^Allow|While using the app|Only this time
wait 2
tapif ^Allow|While using the app|Only this time
wait 3
shot 02-home
tapif ^Active
wait 3
shot 03-active
tap Complete delivery
wait 3
shot 04-otp-sheet
type ^••••$|OTP __OTP__
wait 1
shot 05-otp-typed
tap Mark as delivered
wait 4
shot 06-after-deliver
alive
